Package: odrlITR
Type: Package
Title: Orthogonal Double Residual Learning for Individualized Treatment Rules
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Jiaqi", "Tong", email = "jiaqi.tong@yale.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-8922-3386")),
    person("Fan", "Li", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Learns individualized treatment rules with orthogonal double
    residual learning. Nuisance functions may be estimated by cross-fitted
    Super Learner or parametric models, or supplied by the user. Treatment
    rules are fitted by direct linear or tree optimization and by kernel,
    finite series, or neural surrogate learners. The hinge SVM with bounded
    scores fits a penalized hinge score and applies hard tanh clipping.
